{"code":1,"msg":"ok","time":1793207531,"data":{"contact":{"answer_image":"\/storage\/default\/20250512\/qq-group-qrcode1218690f567c9b29e2bf2c7ef02328d74100ad84.png","wx_image":"https:\/\/www.cie.org.cn\/static\/upload\/image\/20220915\/1663207718181341.png","content":"<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/api.rv.cie.org.cn\/storage\/default\/20250605\/SENDf64c62cb40cb5074327af4d71e0706cd578127df.png\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;position:relative;top:5px\"\/>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">欢迎依托大赛平台开展品牌推广、技术讲演、人才招引、生态运营等多项合作，如有意向，请与大赛办公室联系。<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/api.rv.cie.org.cn\/storage\/default\/20250605\/phone2390f4652bbf27740b815f12275f26e4ff98f686.png\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;position:relative;top:5px\"\/>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">大赛咨询电话<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">：<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">010-68600753<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/api.rv.cie.org.cn\/storage\/default\/20250605\/phone2390f4652bbf27740b815f12275f26e4ff98f686.png\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; width: 18px; height: 18px; position: relative; top: 5px;\"\/>&nbsp;大赛监督电话：010-68600638<\/span><\/span><\/p>"},"contest":{"competition_intro":"<p style=\"line-height: 2em; font-weight:500\"><span pingfang=\"\" helvetica=\"\" hiragino=\"\" sans=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" text-align:=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" background-color:=\"\">为深入贯彻党的二十大和二十届二中、三中、四中全会精神，按照《中华人民共和国国民经济和社会发展第十五个五年规划纲要》关于全链条推动集成电路等重点领域关键核心技术攻关取得决定性突破的重要决策，以及2026年政府工作报告关于打造集成电路等新兴支柱产业的任务部署，中国电子学会联合国内优势单位，连续第二年举办CIE全国RISC-V高水平创新及应用大赛，促进优秀人才与高质量项目加速形成全产业链集聚，为实现高水平科技自立自强，加快推进新型工业化，因地制宜发展新质生产力，提供重要的平台支撑作用。<\/span><\/p>","competition_modality":"<p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong>初赛<\/strong>:提交文档说明材料(若相关成果提交到开源项目，请在说明文档中附上相关的PR\/MR)和演示视频，大赛办公室组织评审委员会以线上通讯方式进行初选。<\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong>决赛<\/strong>:可根据入围项目的开发进展对提交文档(若相关成果提交到开源项目，请在说明文档中附上相关的PR\/MR)和视频进行更新，大赛办公室组织评审委员会进行评审，根据入围项目数量决定是否需要现场讲演和提问。<\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong>总决赛<\/strong>:可根据入围项目的开发进展对提交文档(若相关成果提交到开源项目，请在说明文档中附上相关的PR\/MR)和视频进行更新做线下现场讲演，如需要可作实物展示，并接受评审委员会现场提问，获得最终评分。<\/p>","competition_reward":"<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">(一)&nbsp;<\/span>从决赛阶段开始，得分排名前列的项目均可获得由中国电子学会盖章颁发的奖励证书。如该项目参与的是定向命题比赛<span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">(<\/span>含高水平创新方向和高水平应用方向<span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">)<\/span>，决赛奖励证书将由中国电子学会与比赛牵头命题单位共同盖章颁发。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">(<\/span>二<span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">)&nbsp;<\/span>总决赛阶段，得分排名前列的优胜项目可获得由中国电子学会盖章颁发的奖励证书和纪念奖杯。如该项目参与的是高水平应用方向比赛，将获得相应比赛奖金。根据比赛具体情况，除优胜项目外，将可能再设置技术创新、商业价值、发展潜力等单项奖励。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">(<\/span>三<span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">)&nbsp;<\/span>大赛组织委员会将为比赛过程中涌现出的优秀团队和个人提供在政策辅导、技术指导、地方对接、项目申报、供需沟通、人才培训、宣传推广等方面的激励。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">(<\/span>四<span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\" helvetica=\"\">)&nbsp;<\/span>部分定向命题比赛的牵头命题单位将为各自比赛的优胜项目、团队和个人提供基于自身特色的奖励。<\/span><\/p><p><br\/><\/p>","competition_sate":"<p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, \" microsoft=\"\">（一）报名和初赛<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, \" microsoft=\"\">按不同赛题要求提交文档说明材料（若相关成果提交到开源项目，请在说明文档中附上相关的PR\/MR）或演示视频，大赛办公室组织评审委员会以在线方式进行初选，通过即选拔进入分领域决赛。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, \" microsoft=\"\">（二）决赛<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, \" microsoft=\"\">可根据入围项目的开发进展对提交文档说明材料（若相关成果提交到开源项目，请在说明文档中附上相关的PR\/MR）或演示视频进行更新，大赛办公室组织评审委员会以在线方式进行评审打分，选拔得分排名前列的项目进入全国总决赛。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, \" microsoft=\"\">（三）全国总决赛<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, \" microsoft=\"\">可根据入围项目的开发进展对提交文档说明材料（若相关成果提交到开源项目，请在说明文档中附上相关的PR\/MR）或演示视频进行更新。全国总决赛为线下举办，入选项目需在现场进行限时讲演，如需要可作实物展示，并接受评审委员会现场提问，获得最终评分，决出优胜奖项。说明：以上比赛流程为基本形式，部分比赛方向会根据赛题情况有其他流程要求，具体比赛流程以大赛官网和系统正式公布为准。<\/span><\/p>"},"flow":{"first_competition":{"start_time":"2026-11-16","end_time":"2026-11-27","desc":"预赛时间"},"second_competition":{"start_time":"2026-11-30","end_time":"2026-12-18","desc":"选拔赛时间"},"last_competition":{"start_time":"2026-12-21","end_time":"2027-01-16","desc":"总决赛时间"},"enroll_and_submit":{"start_time":"2026-06-30 00:00:00","end_time":"2026-11-08 23:59:59","desc":"报名时间"},"format_check":{"start_time":"2026-11-09","end_time":"2026-11-13","desc":"格式审查时间"},"first_review":{"start_time":"2026-11-08 00:00:00","end_time":"2026-11-27 23:59:59","desc":"预赛评审时间"},"second_review":{"start_time":"2026-12-07 00:00:00","end_time":"2026-12-18 23:59:59","desc":"选拔赛评审时间"}},"adviser":[{"id":1,"weigh":-6,"role":"1","name":"刘   明","avatar":"\/storage\/default\/20250530\/未标题-11f01a1f1ee